# Expected error: parameter type mismatch. "n" is declared as a number but stands in the item slot of "collect $n 3", and "fish" is an item standing in the count slot.
OQF1
Q	param_type_mismatch	1				Param Type Mismatch
P	fish	item
P	n	number
S	only_step	s			collect $n $fish		finished					Catch the wrong way round
